# Optional: enable an OpenStreetMap-compatible raster tile layer.
# Leave unset to run the interface in local graticule placeholder mode.
# The default OSM tile service is suitable only for light development use and
# must follow the OpenStreetMap tile usage policy. Configure a dedicated
# provider for production deployments.
#
# VITE_MAP_TILE_URL=https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
# VITE_MAP_ATTRIBUTION=© OpenStreetMap contributors
